.TH TWEEN_START 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tween_start \- Animate *target from its current value to `to` over duration seconds using ease
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "void tween_start(Tween *tw, float *target, float to, float duration, EaseFn ease);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Animate *target from its current value to `to` over duration seconds using ease. target must stay valid for the tween's life (a scene static or GameState field).
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tween_update (3),
.BR tween_done (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
